   "source": [
    "## Pregunta 1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "861e5fff-bc79-4456-bd27-b71e42f46ba7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Indica cuÃ¡ntos estudiantes formaron parte del estudio de deporte."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "88b00fc0-3320-4e5f-9f5f-776923b23402",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "92"
      ]
     },
